eetml.sheet"><?cloudpmc-path b427/9903757/06f525d1a9bd/mmc10.xlsx?><?cloudpmc-bucket app?><?size 56419?></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material id="db_ds_supplementary-material11_reqid_" position="float"><?disp-level 2?><caption><title>Document S2.TPR_Kanai</title></caption><media xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="mmc11.pdf" mimetype="application" mime-subtype="pdf"><?cloudpmc-path b427/9903757/bab6d9fa16f1/mmc11.pdf?><?cloudpmc-bucket app?><?size 1560238?></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material id="db_ds_supplementary-material12_reqid_" position="float"><?disp-level 2?><caption><title>Document S3. Article plus supplemental information</title></caption><media xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="mmc12.pdf" mimetype="application" mime-subtype="pdf"><?cloudpmc-path b427/9903757/1b1662f66c55/mmc12.pdf?><?cloudpmc-bucket app?><?size 5441738?></media></supplementary-material></sec><sec id="_adda93_" xml:lang="en" sec-type="data-availability-statement" disp-level="2"><title>Data Availability Statement</title><p>The GBMI summary statistics for the 14 endpoints are publicly available and are browserble at the GBMI PheWeb website (<ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="http://results.globalbiobankmeta.org/" ext-link-type="uri">http://results.globalbiobankmeta.org/</ext-link>). Example outputs from the meta-analysis fine-mapping simulation pipeline have been deposited at Harvard Dataverse. All original code has been deposited at Zenodo and is publicly available as of the date of publication. DOIs and links are listed in the <xref rid="sec5.1" ref-type="sec">key resources table</xref>. Any additional information required to reanalyze the data reported in this paper is available from the <xref rid="sec5.2.1" ref-type="sec">lead contact</xref> upon request.</p></sec></sec></body></article>